hers, and choose how your hero reacts to situations.\n\nThe game pairs RPG-style story, relationships and progression with card-based tactics, so battles are turn-based fights where you play cards for attacks and abilities. It sits in the darker corner of the Marvel Universe. Firaxis Games, known for its strategy titles, developed it. It is single-player only and suits tactics fans and Marvel followers who enjoy character-driven stories."}}